{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-01-09 16:22:00', 'title': 'FEDERMAN & SHERWOOD INVESTIGATES RACKSPACE TECHNOLOGY FOR DATA BREACH', 'text': 'OKLAHOMA CITY--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE LAW FIRM OF FEDERMAN & SHERWOOD HAS INITIATED AN INVESTIGATION INTO RACKSPACE TECHNOLOGY, INC [NASDAQ: RTX] WITH RESPECT TO A DATA BREACH. ON DECEMBER 6, 2022, RACKSPACE REPORTED THAT THEY RECENTLY EXPERIENCED A CYBER INCIDENT THAT INVOLVED UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS TO THEIR NETWORK. IN RESPONSE, RACKSPACE PROMPTLY TOOK STEPS TO SECURE ITS ENVIRONMENT AND INVESTIGATE THE INCIDENT.'}